<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon bourse trade delayed by technical hitch.</title>
<headline>Lisbon bourse trade delayed by technical hitch.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The start of cash bond and stock trade on the Lisbon bourse was being delayed on Tuesday by technical problems, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said it was not clear when trade would get under way. Business should have begun at 0930 GMT.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-315035</p>
</text>
